From 560d4576fc64279f3a8a9a17cfd2b54d17a9cade Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 23:07:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] CPM phase 3: periodic parcels, turbulent dispersion, grading,
 dilatancy, ride-over, limiter with exchanges

- periodic sides (C 21/22) for the parcels, serial and parallel: ghost deposits folded,
  parcels wrapped, ghost flags for the velocity interpolation
- grid-limited step: optimistic acceptance with fix-up (a full row can shear),
  first ghost layer for targets beyond the local domain (was knox+1)
- Q 52/53: turbulent dispersion, random displacement with the eddy diffusivity
- Q 54: lift on exposed grains; Q 55: dilatancy theta_0(I); Q 56: ride-over of blocked grains
- S 51 graded beds (parcel diameter), grain-scale log law gives hiding
- Q 110 suspension boxes, Q 45 seeded solid fraction; no coupling before the start (S 41/43/45)
- hotstart: fixed parcels released unless Q 44 1, parcel print time continues
- VTU output of the parcel eddy diffusivity (CPM_Kt)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SpjSR3V8sRfnHEHg4FD3nA
